		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"title": "葡萄酒",
			"text": "$(thing)葡萄酒$()是另一种酒，酿制方法与其他酒不同。这是一个复杂但值得的过程，无法用机器自动化。想了解如何酿造，请查看$(l:cooking/alcohol#wine_making)葡萄酒酿造$()条目。$(br2)所有葡萄酒除了另一种效果之外，还会提供$(item)力量（5:20）$()！",
			"item": "firmalife:bucket/red_wine,firmalife:bucket/white_wine,firmalife:bucket/rose_wine,firmalife:bucket/sparkling_wine,firmalife:bucket/dessert_wine",
			"anchor": "wine"
		},
